# Nomad AI — secrets.
#
# NOT loaded by the app in the browser. index.html serves plain files; there
# is no build step to read this. It exists for two things:
#
#   netlify env:import .env      pushes these to the Netlify site in one go
#   netlify dev                  makes them process.env.* for a local function
#
# So nothing changes until something server-side reads them — the function
# proxy, or a build step that writes nomad-config.js at deploy time.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# ⚠ GEMINI_API_KEY is the same key the Next.js project in
#   Downloads/nomad-ai uses. Anything that exposes it here exposes it there
#   too — mint a separate restricted key before publishing.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
TWOGIS_API_KEY=
